        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>\"BV\" Style Pivot  for Aluminum or Hollow Metal Doors</b>\r\n<p>\r\nReplacement for Jackson 20-1680 \"BV\" center hung bottom pivot hinge set. Door Controls BV Pivot sets are designed for use with aluminum framed storefront doors or properly prepared wood and hollow metal doors up to 125 pounds. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BV-pivot_size.gif?v=1704354566\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Jackson 20-1680 BV pivot size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPivot bearing mounts to door threshold and/or floor plate. Bearing bracket attaches to bottom of door (Door Rail).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n For Threshold  & Floor Application\r\n- 1\" (25.4mm) Deep Bottom Door Rail\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For Center Hung Doors up to 125 Lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Height Adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Full Ball Bearing Design</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BV-pivot.pdf?v=1704262279\" target=\"new\"><b>Jackson 20-1680 \"BV\" Pivot Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with bearing, floor mounting plate, bearing bracket, mounting anchors and screws.\r\n</p>",
